# SHContent DevOps

**Production:** https://workflow.sherifharidyjewelry.com · **VPS:** `/opt/shcontent`  
**Runtime:** Python API via `systemctl shcontent-api` (not Docker Traefik stack yet).

## Deploy

Push to `main` runs `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`: rsync → `pip install` → `alembic upgrade head` → `systemctl restart shcontent-api`.

Secrets: `VPS_HOST`, `VPS_USER`, `VPS_SSH_KEY`.

When adding Traefik routing, follow `sh-ops/docs/DEVOPS.md` (workflow subdomain, `root_default`, domains overlay).
